WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.043 --> 00:00:16.364
ended and the laughter quieted down.

2
00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:19.205
People were returning home.

3
00:00:19.225 --> 00:00:21.745
"What happens now?"

4
00:00:22.345 --> 00:00:23.586
Mandy asked Rishi.

5
00:00:23.606 --> 00:00:26.386
"We wash," said Rishi.

6
00:00:26.406 --> 00:00:28.647
"And life continues."

7
00:00:29.927 --> 00:00:31.808
Vinnie and Mandy looked around.

8
00:00:33.052 --> 00:00:35.194
They still did not know where they were.

9
00:00:35.214 --> 00:00:39.416
"Rishi, we're new here," said Vinnie.

10
00:00:39.436 --> 00:00:41.598
"What is this place?"

11
00:00:41.618 --> 00:00:45.500
"The city of Patna," Rishi said.

12
00:00:46.521 --> 00:00:49.603
He noticed Vinnie and Mandy still looked confused.

13
00:00:49.623 --> 00:00:52.745
"India!" he shouted.

14
00:00:52.765 --> 00:00:56.908
"Wow!" cried Vinnie and Mandy.

15
00:00:58.229 --> 00:01:00.190
Rishi stared at them curiously.

16
00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:02.752
"Where are you from?"

17
00:01:03.252 --> 00:01:03.752
he asked.

18
00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:07.194
"America," said Mandy.

19
00:01:07.214 --> 00:01:11.115
"America?" repeated Rishi.

20
00:01:11.135 --> 00:01:13.556
"I've never heard of it."

21
00:01:14.877 --> 00:01:17.158
Suddenly, a young girl ran up.

22
00:01:18.518 --> 00:01:22.700
"Rishi! Mother says to come and wash," said the girl.

23
00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:26.902
"This is Rima, my sister," Rishi said.

24
00:01:27.802 --> 00:01:29.663
He introduced Vinnie and Mandy.

25
00:01:29.683 --> 00:01:32.384
"Would you like to meet my parents?"

26
00:01:32.832 --> 00:01:33.372
he asked.

27
00:01:33.392 --> 00:01:36.734
"We'd love to," said Mandy.

28
00:01:37.835 --> 00:01:41.377
Rishi and Rima's house was made of mud and bamboo.

29
00:01:42.638 --> 00:01:44.599
The roof was made of palm leaves.

30
00:01:45.739 --> 00:01:48.401
A small clay stove was in a porch area.

31
00:01:49.581 --> 00:01:52.323
Rishi's mother was stirring rice in a pot.

32
00:01:53.464 --> 00:01:57.206
His father was standing next to her wearing a white turban.

33
00:01:58.466 --> 00:02:01.248
Rishi introduced the children to his parents.

34
00:02:02.792 --> 00:02:07.656
"Hello," Vinnie and Mandy said, putting their hands together and bowing.

35
00:02:08.837 --> 00:02:11.279
Rishi's father did the same and smiled.

36
00:02:11.299 --> 00:02:15.562
"The boys will wash first," said his father.

37
00:02:16.983 --> 00:02:20.626
Vinnie followed Rishi outside to a large jug of water.

38
00:02:22.168 --> 00:02:24.850
With a cup, Rishi scooped up some water.

39
00:02:26.091 --> 00:02:27.412
He handed it to Vinnie.

40
00:02:27.432 --> 00:02:30.814
"You wash first," said Rishi.

41
00:02:30.834 --> 00:02:33.952
"Thanks," replied Vinnie.

42
00:02:35.093 --> 00:02:37.153
He emptied the cup over his head.

43
00:02:38.273 --> 00:02:40.254
Shocked, Rishi stared at him.

44
00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:44.155
Then he said: "Do not waste water."

45
00:02:44.175 --> 00:02:49.797
"I'm sorry," said Vinnie, his face turning red.

46
00:02:49.817 --> 00:02:54.558
"We have a short rainy season," explained Rishi.

47
00:02:54.578 --> 00:02:58.899
"So we collect rainwater in a well outside the village."

48
00:03:00.119 --> 00:03:01.760
Rishi filled the cup again.

49
00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:06.823
He dipped his fingers in the cup and rubbed water on his arms.

50
00:03:06.843 --> 00:03:11.406
"Water is very valuable," Rishi continued.

51
00:03:11.426 --> 00:03:14.389
"We must not waste one drop."

52
00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:18.912
Embarrassed, Vinnie looked at the puddle at his feet.

53
00:03:20.173 --> 00:03:25.917
Inside the house, Mandy was looking at a row of statues on a low table.

54
00:03:25.937 --> 00:03:28.139
"What's this?"

55
00:03:28.819 --> 00:03:29.660
Mandy asked.

56
00:03:30.824 --> 00:03:35.207
She pointed to a statue of a four-headed person with four arms.

57
00:03:35.227 --> 00:03:38.729
"Brahma," explained Rima.

58
00:03:38.749 --> 00:03:41.851
"He is the creator of the universe.

59
00:03:43.252 --> 00:03:45.633
Brahma is one of our three main gods."

60
00:03:46.994 --> 00:03:48.195
"Who are the others?"

61
00:03:48.795 --> 00:03:49.555
asked Mandy.

62
00:03:50.656 --> 00:03:53.638
There was a dark blue statue with four arms.

63
00:03:54.899 --> 00:03:57.040
Each of its arms held an object.

64
00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:02.964
"That is Vishnu, the preserver of the universe," said Rima.

65
00:04:02.984 --> 00:04:05.366
"And this is Shiva."

66
00:04:06.187 --> 00:04:10.490
The statue of Shiva sat with its legs crossed and eyes closed.

67
00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:13.573
"The destroyer of the universe."

68
00:04:14.854 --> 00:04:17.757
Mandy looked at the smaller statues on the table.

69
00:04:17.777 --> 00:04:20.619
"Are all of these gods?"

70
00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:21.900
she asked.

71
00:04:23.141 --> 00:04:23.962
Rima nodded.

72
00:04:23.982 --> 00:04:26.124
"We worship many gods."

73
00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.703
Vinnie and Rishi returned.

74
00:04:30.844 --> 00:04:31.826
They looked cleaner.

75
00:04:31.846 --> 00:04:35.531
"It's your turn," Vinnie said to Mandy.

76
00:04:35.551 --> 00:04:38.556
"Oh, and don't waste water."

77
00:04:39.717 --> 00:04:43.903
Mandy gave him a puzzled look and headed outside with Rima.
